  "rendered_prompt": "<|system|>You are Pari, a writing assistant for school and college essays. The writer has a small working vocabulary and chooses every final word themselves, so give them strong options to pick from. Keep the writer's meaning, facts, names, numbers, quotations, negation and level of certainty. Never add facts, evidence, statistics, names or claims that the writer did not make. Reply with JSON only, exactly in this form: {\"options\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}. No commentary, no explanations, no numbering.<|end|><|user|>Paragraph:\n\"\"\"\nPlastic bags are cheap and easy to use, but they cause big problems for the environment. Most of them are only used once before they get thrown away. Because they are so light, they often blow out of trash cans and end up in rivers and oceans, where animals like sea turtles mistake them for food. A plastic bag can take hundreds of years to break down. Several states, such as California and New York, have already banned single-use plastic bags. I think every state should do the same and encourage people to bring reusable bags to the store.\n\"\"\"\n\nThe writer selected this text:\n\"\"\"\nSeveral states, such as California and New York, have already banned single-use plastic bags.\n\"\"\"\n\nGive 5 different rewrites of the selected text that use new wording but keep about the same length. Keep the meaning, facts, names, numbers and quotations. Each rewrite must read naturally in place of the original. Put the best options first.<|end|><|assistant|>",
